# Same three-position mapping as 50-fltmodes-3pos-land, with RTL in place of
# LAND on the last notch.
#
# Apply this ONLY after:
#   - ./calibrate_compass.py has written offsets and they are under 400
#   - ./gps_check.py has shown a 3D fix with 8+ satellites, outdoors
#   - the heading in a GCS points the right way as you rotate the airframe
#
# RTL is the mode that hands control back when something goes wrong, and it
# is worth having -- but only once it can be trusted to fly towards you.
FLTMODE1,0
FLTMODE2,0
FLTMODE3,2
FLTMODE4,2
FLTMODE5,6
FLTMODE6,6
FLTMODE_CH,5
